    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are a Digital Overload AI Analyzer.\n\nAnalyze the student's daily workload and identify:\n1. Overload level\n2. Excessive context switching\n3. Unrealistic planning\n4. Main distractions\n5. Important priorities\n\nThen provide:\n- Overload Score\n- Main Problem\n- Top Priorities\n- Suggested Schedule\n- Focus Tip\n\nStudent Details:\n\nName: {{$json[\"Name\"]}}\n\nDaily Tasks:\n{{$json[\"Daily Tasks\"]}}\n\nNotifications:\n{{$json[\"Notifications\"]}}\n\nAssignments:\n{{$json[\"Assignments\"]}}\n\nPersonal Commitments:\n{{$json[\"Personal Commitments\"]}}\n\nReturn output ONLY as valid JSON.\n\nDo not use markdown.\nDo not use explanation outside JSON.\n\nUse exactly this JSON structure:\n\n{\n  \"overload_score\": \"\",\n  \"burnout_risk\": \"\",\n  \"main_problem\": \"\",\n  \"priority_tasks\": [],\n  \"can_delay\": [],\n  \"suggested_schedule\": \"\",\n  \"focus_tip\": \"\",\n  \"confidence_score\": \"\"\n}",
        "batching": {}
      },
